==History==
2024
*The Musketeer's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 4/11/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/11/2024)|November 2024 Update]].
*On 14/11/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/11/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Musketeer's Sniper damage to 180% of her damage (from 150%).
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], fixed various bugs with the Evolved Musketeer.
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Musketeer's first attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 0.8 seconds).
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Evolved Musketeer's hitpoints by 0.06%, and her damage by 0.45%.

